/// A local variable referenced in a case other than its declaration.
///
/// Identifiers are meant to be case-insensitive, so 'count' and 'Count' name
/// one variable.  Today the environment keys each scope on the raw lexeme, so
/// the second spelling does not resolve.
///
/// Fails with: Undefined variable 'count'.
///
test 'A local variable resolves through any spelling of its name';
begin
    var Count : Integer := 1;

    AssertEqual (1, count);
end
